&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;ASM is an equal opportunity employer and considers qualified applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, age, nationality, social or ethnic origin, sexual orientation, gender, gender identify or expression, marital status, pregnancy, political affiliation, disability, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join ASM’s global internship program and turn theory into real-world innovation.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ASM is seeking talented and passionate early career graduates to join our team of experts in the semiconductor engineering space. We offer exciting roles such as Field Service Engineers, Field Process Engineers, Process Engineers, Software Engineers and more. Engage with advanced technologies and be part of the growing semiconductor ecosystem and work with leading chip manufacturers to drive innovation in the semiconductor industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here are some available intern and graduate positions on offer:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Engineers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advance next-generation semiconductor technology by running experiments, process qualifications, and hardware evaluations that help bring innovative products to market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve real-world engineering challenges by troubleshooting advanced equipment, analyzing process data, and driving improvements in manufacturing performance and reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain hands-on experience with cutting-edge tools while collaborating with engineers, technicians, and operators to develop and optimize semiconductor processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make a measurable impact by supporting customer demonstrations, technology evaluations, and continuous improvement initiatives that shape the future of the semiconductor industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work hands-on with advanced deposition technologies like ALD, PEALD, PECVD, and epitaxy to develop next-gen devices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Engineers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop advanced software for industry-leading semiconductor technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;See your code drive the operation of some of the most sophisticated semiconductor equipment in the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with a global team of talented software engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the next generation of semiconductor equipment control software and automation technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mechanical Engineers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and engineer semiconductor products using mechanical design, simulation, and analytical problem-solving techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build detailed 3D CAD models and engineering drawings while supporting prototype development and production readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate technical challenges through troubleshooting and failure analysis to improve product performance and reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineering, sourcing, manufacturing, suppliers, and customers to deliver innovative solutions from concept through production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Electrical Engineers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design the technology behind advanced semiconductor equipment, creating electrical systems, controls, and hardware that power next-generation chip manufacturing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn ideas into reality by developing sub-assemblies, integrating system components, and customizing solutions to meet customer and product requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive innovation and continuous improvement through design reviews, engineering change projects, testing, and performance validation of new hardware solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate across global teams to solve complex technical challenges, support product development, and bring cutting-edge technologies from concept to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;QA Engineers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with advanced semiconductor technology, troubleshooting software, hardware, and control system challenges that impact cutting-edge manufacturing equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive product quality and reliability by testing new software releases, identifying bugs, validating fixes, and enhancing automated regression testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain hands-on experience with both software simulators and real production tools while collaborating closely with global engineering, QA, and product support teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make a global impact by supporting product installations, training, and technical problem-solving at customer sites around the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Intelligence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply data science, AI, and machine learning to drive innovation in semiconductor equipment and process technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop predictive models that improve product performance, process stability, and manufacturing outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize statistical analysis, experimentation, and hardware characterization data to optimize next-generation semiconductor solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate insights and recommendations across cross-functional teams to influence engineering and business decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
