&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and engineer semiconductor products using mechanical design, simulation, and analytical problem-solving techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build detailed 3D CAD models and engineering drawings while supporting prototype development and production readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate technical challenges through troubleshooting and failure analysis to improve product performance and reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineering, sourcing, manufacturing, suppliers, and customers to deliver innovative solutions from concept through production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
