&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is a rare opportunity to lead ASM&#39;s technology engagement with one of the world&#39;s most influential semiconductor manufacturers and help shape the future of next-generation memory architectures that will power artificial intelligence, high-performance computing, and the data-driven world of tomorrow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Over the next decade, the semiconductor industry will make some of its largest-ever investments in advanced memory technologies. The winners will help unlock new levels of AI performance, computing power, and technological progress. As a key technology leader for ASM, you will play a pivotal role in ensuring we are at the forefront of that transformation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
