&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Develop a deep understanding of customer challenges, technology roadmaps, integration requirements, manufacturing constraints, and future device architectures. Translate those insights into actions that influence ASM&#39;s long-term strategy and technology investments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
