&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be working on&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Developing and optimizing unit processes (ALD, PEALD, Epitaxy, furnace, or PECVD) on assigned applications&lt;br&gt;• Owning day-to-day customer requests on a single product/film: scoping the issue, running the experiment, presenting the result&lt;br&gt;• Designing and executing Design of Experiments (DOEs) to validate new technology performance and accelerate readiness for high-volume manufacturing (HVM)&lt;br&gt;• Validating tool performance and feeding structured findings back to Product Management to improve the product&lt;br&gt;• Implementing Best Known Methods (BKMs) and documenting qualification results so the team gets faster every cycle&lt;br&gt;• Bringing innovative ideas to recipe tuning and staying current with the state of the art&lt;br&gt;• Identifying safety risks on the tool and helping train newer engineers on safe execution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MS in Chemical Engineering, Materials Science, Physics, Mechanical Engineering, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;0-6 years of experience in semiconductor process engineering, thin-film deposition, or a related field&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Hands-on experience with at least one thin-film deposition technology through research, internships, academic projects, or industry experience&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Working knowledge of statistics and Design of Experiments (DOE); able to analyze data and present findings effectively&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with familiarity in structured troubleshooting methodologies&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Clear written and verbal communication skills; able to prepare technical reports and present results to internal and customer teams&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Willingness to travel 25-50% domestically and internationally to support customer activities&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Professional working proficiency in English and Chinese&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What sets you apart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
