&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Why join ASM? &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We’re&amp;nbsp;looking for engineers who are excited to work&amp;nbsp;hands&lt;/span&gt;‑&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;on&amp;nbsp;at the crossroads of hardware, software, and&amp;nbsp;cutting&lt;/span&gt;‑&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;edge&amp;nbsp;process technology.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you love diving into complex systems, bringing structure to ambiguity, and shaping action plans that move real innovation forward—and you want to be part of a&amp;nbsp;fast&lt;/span&gt;‑&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;growing, disruptive company at the center of the global semiconductor industry, ASM is the place for you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Here,&amp;nbsp;you’ll&amp;nbsp;find&amp;nbsp;long&lt;/span&gt;‑&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;term&amp;nbsp;growth opportunities at the forefront of semiconductor technology.&amp;nbsp;You’ll&amp;nbsp;work on&amp;nbsp;industry&lt;/span&gt;‑&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;leading&amp;nbsp;tools that power&amp;nbsp;next&lt;/span&gt;‑&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;generation&amp;nbsp;technologies, supported by a culture that values people, continuous learning, and disciplined execution. Your first role as an FSE is just the beginning. With clear pathways into technical leadership, operations, product roles, program management, technical sales, and&amp;nbsp;customer&lt;/span&gt;‑&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;facing&amp;nbsp;engineering careers, ASM gives you the flexibility to grow in the direction that fits you best—at the heart of an industry that makes AI possible.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;2026 is the year to join ASM as a Field Service Engineer. Apply now! &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make the tech that enables the chips in devices which improve lives around the world. We do this with an eye to the future, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible through cutting-edge innovation, and driving the next wave of technological breakthroughs that shape how we live, work, and connect.&lt;/p&gt;
