&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Lead troubleshooting of complex tool and process issues using structured diagnostic methods&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Perform in‑depth root‑cause analysis and recommend data‑driven corrective actions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
