&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Deliver clear, timely, customer‑focused support with a safety‑first mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
