&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate, understand and identify current customer needs &amp;amp; new opportunities, while also anticipating future needs and building long-term sustainable relationship and solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
