&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job&#39;s mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Engineer II, Global Product Support at ASM, you will play a key role in ensuring the successful introduction, deployment, and lifecycle support of ASM&#39;s advanced semiconductor equipment. Acting as a system-level technical expert, you will work closely with Product Development, Manufacturing, Field Service, and Customer Support teams to drive New Product Introductions (NPI), continuous product improvements, and field readiness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for an experienced semiconductor equipment engineer who enjoys solving complex technical challenges, leading cross-functional initiatives, and bridging product development with customer-facing operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be working on&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own assigned products throughout the product lifecycle, from concept and development through alpha, beta, and product release phases.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Serve as the system-level product expert across hardware, software, electrical, and process domains.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lead New Product Introduction (NPI) and Continuous Improvement Program (CIP) activities to ensure successful product deployment and operational readiness.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Develop test plans, coordinate demo lab activities, and support field implementation readiness for new products and features.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Drive Design for Service (DFS) and Design for Install (DFI) initiatives through product design reviews and cross-functional collaboration.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Develop, document, and deploy Best Known Methods (BKMs), installation procedures, and operational guidelines to support scalable field execution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Collaborate with engineering, manufacturing, FEMS, and field teams to identify, troubleshoot, and resolve critical product issues.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Support product validation, system integration activities, and smooth transitions between alpha and beta development phases.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lead technical taskforces for complex product issues, providing technical direction, escalation management, and stakeholder communication.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Drive root cause investigations and corrective actions to improve product performance, reliability, and customer satisfaction.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Support global field organizations by providing technical expertise, coaching, and readiness guidance for new product releases.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
