&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working closely with Process Engineers and technology development teams, this position enables accelerated process development by providing dedicated engineering coverage for DOE execution, tool qualifications, hardware evaluations, and process demonstrations.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The ideal candidate combines strong engineering fundamentals with hands-on laboratory execution skills and thrives in a fast-paced semiconductor development environment.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
