&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ASM is seeking talented and passionate early career graduates to join our team of experts in the semiconductor engineering space. We offer exciting roles such as Field Service Engineers, Field Process Engineers, Process Engineers, Software Engineers and more. Engage with advanced technologies and be part of the growing semiconductor ecosystem and work with leading chip manufacturers to drive innovation in the semiconductor industry.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here are some available positions on offer:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Field Service Engineers (FSE)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot and maintain advanced semiconductor equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with leading semiconductor manufacturers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel and customer-facing opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant majors: Mechanical Engineering, Electrical Engineering, Mechatronics, Physics, and Engineering Technology backgrounds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Field Process Engineers (FPE)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize semiconductor manufacturing processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze equipment performance and process data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineering and customer teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant majors: Materials Science, Chemical Engineering, Physics; STEM majors encouraged to apply&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Engineers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work hands-on with advanced deposition technologies like ALD, PEALD, PECVD, and epitaxy to develop next-gen devices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and manage complex process development projects, analyze material performance, and turn data into breakthroughs, contributing to IP and innovation in a global R&amp;amp;D environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Masters and PhD candidates in any relevant science or engineering field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why ASM?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Discover and work with advanced materials, deposition technologies, and next-generation semiconductor processes, solving challenges at the atomic scale. Your discoveries could power the systems that move the world.&lt;/p&gt;
