&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Launch Your Career in Semiconductor Technology&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have you recently graduated or are you early in your engineering career and looking for an opportunity to work with some of the most advanced technology in the world?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At ASM, you&#39;ll join a team that enables the next generation of semiconductor chips. As an &lt;strong&gt;Early Career Field Service Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, you will receive hands-on training, mentorship from experienced engineers, and the opportunity to work directly with cutting-edge ALD and Epitaxy equipment at some of the world&#39;s leading semiconductor manufacturers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a desk job. You&#39;ll be in the field, solving real engineering challenges, supporting customers, and developing technical expertise that will set the foundation for a long-term career in the semiconductor industry&lt;/p&gt;
What does this role look like?&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Learn and Grow&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in a structured training and development program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn how to install, operate, maintain, and troubleshoot ASM semiconductor equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside experienced Field Service Engineers and technical experts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop expertise in vacuum systems, electronics, robotics, software, and semiconductor manufacturing processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Support Leading Semiconductor Manufacturers&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with equipment installations, upgrades, and qualifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform preventive maintenance and basic troubleshooting activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support customers in resolving technical issues and minimizing equipment downtime.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help ensure ASM equipment operates at peak performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Build Technical Expertise&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose mechanical, electrical, and system-level issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in root cause investigations and problem-solving activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document service activities and technical findings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineering and global support teams to solve complex challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Work as Part of a Global Team&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with customers, engineers, and colleagues from around the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share knowledge and learn from industry experts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to continuous improvement initiatives focused on reliability, productivity, and customer satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Education&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Electrical Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mechanical Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chemical Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Physics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Materials Science&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mechatronics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Electronics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Or a related technical discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Attributes&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious and eager to learn new technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving and analytical skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on mindset with an interest in troubleshooting equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and teamwork skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-focused with a positive, can-do attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in a dynamic, fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Travel &amp;amp; Flexibility&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel extensively during the first year for training (up to 70% to Asia, US or Europe)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in cleanroom environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to support customer schedules when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Why Start Your Career at ASM?&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀 Work on the technology that powers AI, smartphones, electric vehicles, and next-generation computing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌍 Travel internationally and gain exposure to leading semiconductor manufacturers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎓 Receive world-class training, mentorship, and career development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔬 Develop expertise in one of the fastest-growing and most innovative industries in the world&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤝 Join a collaborative team that invests in your success from day one&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📈 Build a career path that can lead into senior technical, engineering, or leadership roles&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Your Future Starts Here&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At ASM, you won&#39;t just learn about semiconductor technology, you&#39;ll help shape it. If you&#39;re passionate about engineering, problem-solving, and working with cutting-edge technology, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make the tech that enables the chips in devices which improve lives around the world. We do this with an eye to the future, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible through cutting-edge innovation, and driving the next wave of technological breakthroughs that shape how we live, work, and connect.&lt;/p&gt;
