&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job&#39;s Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At ASM, we&#39;re helping shape the future of technology. Every day, our equipment enables the semiconductor innovations that power artificial intelligence, advanced computing, cloud infrastructure, automotive electronics, and next-generation devices around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the semiconductor industry continues to experience rapid growth, ASM is proactively building relationships with talented Field Service professionals across the United States for current and future opportunities. Whether you&#39;re an early-career Field Service Technician, an experienced Field Service Engineer, or an accomplished people leader, you&#39;ll have the opportunity to work on industry-leading technology, support some of the world&#39;s most advanced semiconductor manufacturers, and make a direct impact on the technologies that drive modern life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is more than a field service role. It&#39;s an opportunity to solve complex technical challenges, partner closely with customers, expand your expertise on cutting-edge systems, and build a long-term career with a global technology leader. At ASM, you&#39;ll join a team that values innovation, collaboration, technical excellence, and continuous growth while helping power the next era of semiconductor manufacturing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Working On&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Install, qualify, maintain, troubleshoot, and repair advanced semiconductor capital equipment at customer sites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose and resolve electrical, mechanical, vacuum, robotics, software, and process-related system issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform preventative and corrective maintenance activities to ensure optimal equipment performance and reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted technical partner to customers by providing responsive support and delivering exceptional service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document service activities, maintenance actions, and technical findings accurately and thoroughly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Engineering, Manufacturing, Product Support, and R&amp;amp;D teams to resolve complex technical challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support equipment upgrades, process improvements, and new technology introductions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive customer satisfaction through strong communication, technical expertise, and a commitment to operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For senior and management-level roles, mentor team members, lead customer escalations, and support organizational growth and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re interested in connecting with professionals who enjoy solving technical challenges, thrive in hands-on environments, and are passionate about supporting advanced technology. We welcome talent ranging from emerging technicians to experienced engineers and field service leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Associate&#39;s degree, Bachelor&#39;s degree, military technical training, or equivalent experience in Engineering, Electronics, Mechatronics, Electrical Technology, Mechanical Technology, Semiconductor Technology, or a related technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong mechanical and electrical troubleshooting aptitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and the ability to build strong customer relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in semiconductor manufacturing and cleanroom environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness and ability to travel as required to support customer sites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidates must be authorized to work in the United States on a permanent basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Sets You Apart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting semiconductor equipment, capital equipment, or highly complex manufacturing systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of vacuum systems, robotics, automation, plasma systems, RF technology, gas delivery systems, or process equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous field service, maintenance, military electronics, installation, commissioning, or technical support experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working directly with customers in high-tech manufacturing environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A customer-first mindset and the ability to build trusted relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong troubleshooting skills and a passion for solving complex technical problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership, mentoring, coaching, or people management experience for senior and manager-level opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A commitment to continuous improvement, learning, and technical excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A desire to be part of an organization helping drive the future of semiconductor manufacturing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation assistance is available for qualified candidates willing to relocate to one of ASM&#39;s U.S. hiring locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why ASM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with some of the most advanced semiconductor equipment in the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support leading semiconductor manufacturers at the forefront of technology innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities available from Field Service Technician through Senior Engineer and Field Service Management levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation, comprehensive benefits, and career development opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation assistance available for qualified candidates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a collaborative global team focused on innovation, customer success, and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ASM is building our future talent pipeline today. If you&#39;re interested in exploring current or future Field Service opportunities with a company driving the next generation of semiconductor innovation, we&#39;d love to connect with you.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
