indows and other operating systems.&lt;br&gt;2. C# programming skills. PowerShell scripting skills.&lt;br&gt;3. Understanding of SW development cycle, from requirements to testing, integration and delivery.&lt;br&gt;4. Systems Management Experience with MS Windows.&lt;br&gt;5. A team-player attitude and strong written and verbal communication skills are a must.&lt;br&gt;6. Ability to travel and to work in a Clean Room environment.&lt;br&gt;7. Excellent communication and customer service skills.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Minimum BS CS or related Engineering degree with experience in software development&lt;br&gt;2. Experience with the following, a plus, but not required:&lt;br&gt;3. Experience with Manufacturing Communication protocols, specifically SECS/GEM.&lt;br&gt;4. Ethernet TCP/IP and RS-232 communication interfaces&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
