&lt;p&gt;The Manager, Business Management Operations (BMO) is responsible for the end-to-end execution of After Market Business opportunities, ensuring successful delivery from forecast through manufacturing, shipment, and revenue realization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role serves as the key coordinator across Sales, Field Service, Manufacturing, Supply Chain, Engineering, and Operations teams to ensure customer commitments are fulfilled on time and business objectives are achieved.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a player-coach management role with no direct reports. Success is achieved through strong leadership, influence, and cross-functional collaboration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
