&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end Forecast-to-Ship process for After Market Business opportunities, ensuring on-time delivery and revenue realization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate cross-functional activities across Sales, Field Service, Manufacturing, Supply Chain, Engineering, and Operations to drive successful execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate customer and business requirements into clear manufacturing and operational plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-work with Global operation team (manufacturing/supply chain) and ensure material readiness, manufacturing alignment, and shipment commitments are achieved according to schedule.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, manage, and mitigate operational risks while driving timely issue resolution and stakeholder alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare clear and concise business updates, shipment forecasts, revenue outlooks, and executive-level reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support refurbishment, upgrade, and installed-base business activities by leveraging equipment knowledge and operational expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
