&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Business, Engineering, Operations, Supply Chain, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in Business Operations, Program Management, Supply Chain, Manufacturing Operations, Field Service, or related functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in semiconductor equipment, capital equipment, or high-technology manufacturing environments preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting refurbishment, upgrade, or after-market business activities is highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Field Service or customer-facing operational experience is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen and understanding of operational execution processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business-level English communication skills, both written and verbal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management and relationship-building capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management and risk management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to communicate complex issues clearly, concisely, and logically.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive problem-solving mindset with the ability to drive issues to closure through cross-functional collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
