&lt;li&gt;Co-create with Business and maintain a digital roadmap that aligns business priorities with ASM&#39;s enterprise strategy and transformation objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business strategies, challenges, and opportunities into a prioritized portfolio of digital initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate, challenge, and shape incoming business demand to ensure investments are aligned to strategic goals and measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary interface between business stakeholders and Digital Transformation teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive value realization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
