&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;’s Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Field&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Process Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for ASM’s Samsung account in Korea, you will lead a team of Field Process Engineers. Your mission is to ensure world-class service delivery, drive customer satisfaction, and support ASM’s aftermarket sales strategy. This role is critical to maintaining strong relationships with strategic customers and delivering key business outcomes in collaboration with ASM’s global leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Working On&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
