&lt;p&gt;This position requires significant engagement with strategic customers and is relied upon by a number of ASM senior leaders and executive management stakeholders for delivering on both customer satisfaction initiatives and key business results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Roles and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
