&lt;p&gt;As a people leader within the factory organization, you will work closely with Process Engineering, Production, Quality, Maintenance, and other cross-functional teams to optimize performance, solve complex operational challenges, and build scalable capabilities that support business growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
