&lt;li&gt;Support implementation of digital manufacturing solutions, automation initiatives, and advanced analytics to improve operational effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong partnerships across manufacturing, engineering, supply chain, and quality organizations to achieve business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote ASM values while maintaining a safe, inclusive, and high-performance work environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
