&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within semiconductor wafer fabrication, deposition, advanced packaging, or related manufacturing technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior leadership experience managing technicians, operators, or manufacturing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of statistical process control (SPC), manufacturing KPIs, and factory performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
