&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Position Summary&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW91514540 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW91514540 BCX8&quot;&gt;We are seeking a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW91514540 BCX8&quot;&gt; Product Life Cycle&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW91514540 BCX8&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW91514540 BCX8&quot;&gt;PLC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW91514540 BCX8&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW91514540 BCX8&quot;&gt; Supply &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW91514540 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Manager /&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;(NPME) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW91514540 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW91514540 BCX8&quot;&gt;New Product Manufacturing Engineer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; to lead manufacturing readiness for new and evolving semiconductor equipment platforms from concept through production release.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will serve as a critical link between Engineering, Manufacturing, Supply Chain, Quality, Product Safety, Field Service, and Program Management to ensure new products are manufacturable, scalable, serviceable, and ready for successful customer deployment. You will drive manufacturing deliverables throughout the Product Life Cycle (PLC), ensuring readiness assessments, risk mitigation, process validation, and production launch requirements are completed with objective evidence and measurable results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate brings strong experience in New Product Introduction (NPI), manufacturing engineering, risk management, and cross-functional program execution within a complex capital equipment environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Manufacturing Readiness &amp;amp; Product Launch&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead manufacturing readiness activities for prototype, Alpha, Beta, and production builds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and validate manufacturing assembly processes, test methods, and production workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Design for Manufacturing (DFM) and Design for Assembly (DFA) improvements with Engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure tooling, fixtures, manufacturing equipment, factory resources, and training programs are in place before production release.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct readiness reviews before critical builds, customer shipments, and production launches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capture lessons learned from early builds and drive continuous improvement throughout the product lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;PLC Governance &amp;amp; Tollgate Management&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own manufacturing deliverables and readiness evidence for Concept, Design, Alpha, Beta, and Production Release milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in PLC and tollgate reviews, providing objective assessments of manufacturing readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure release decisions are supported by measurable evidence, risk assessments, and validated processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify readiness gaps early and drive action plans to closure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support risk acceptance and exception processes when business conditions require controlled deviations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Risk Management &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead or support PFMEA activities, manufacturing risk assessments, CAPA investigations, and nonconformance resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain visibility of manufacturing risks, corrective actions, ownership, and closure plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive root-cause analysis and implementation of sustainable corrective actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate issues that could impact product quality, safety, manufacturing performance, customer commitments, or production schedules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with cross-functional teams to improve manufacturability, quality, and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Supply Chain &amp;amp; Configuration Readiness&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure BOM structures and product configurations are mature and production ready.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Supply Chain teams to confirm material availability, supplier readiness, and component risk mitigation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support engineering change implementation and configuration management activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verify production requirements are aligned with supply chain capabilities and manufacturing capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Production Release Readiness&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prior to recommending production release, ensure readiness in the following areas:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manufacturing safety requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PFMEA completion and risk mitigation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BOM and configuration maturity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supplier and material readiness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assembly and test procedures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manufacturing tooling and fixtures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training and workforce readiness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manufacturing and supplier quality plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CAPA and nonconformance management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Packaging and shipment readiness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Factory capacity and resource planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Labor and cycle-time validation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Completion of required PLC manufacturing deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in mechanical engineering, Electrical Engineering, Manufacturing Engineering, Industrial Engineering, or a related technical discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in Manufacturing Engineering, New Product Introduction (NPI), Product Engineering, or a related role supporting complex capital equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience introducing complex electromechanical products into manufacturing environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New Product Introduction (NPI) methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product Lifecycle Management (PLC/PLM) processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PFMEA and structured risk management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design for Manufacturing (DFM) and Design for Assembly (DFA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BOM management and engineering change control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Root cause analysis and CAPA processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manufacturing work instructions and test procedures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production readiness and release reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management, problem-solving, and cross-functional collaboration skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to effectively communicate and influence stakeholders across Engineering, Operations, Supply Chain, Quality, and Program Management organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in semiconductor capital equipment or semiconductor manufacturing environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with vacuum systems, gas and chemical delivery systems, robotics, motion control systems, electrical controls, thermal systems, plasma processing equipment, or other complex semiconductor equipment subsystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of SEMI standards and semiconductor equipment manufacturing requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting product transitions from prototype through high-volume manufacturing (HVM).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using ERP, PLM, and MES systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with configuration management and structured BOM control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lean Manufacturing, Six Sigma, 8D, DOE, or other continuous improvement methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Success Profile&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive manufacturing readiness across all phases of product development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and mitigate manufacturing risks before they impact production or customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver objective evidence supporting product release decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence cross-functional teams to achieve operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance technical rigor, manufacturing efficiency, quality, and business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate critical risks when readiness criteria have not been met.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join a team developing next-generation semiconductor equipment and play a key role in bringing innovative products from concept to production. You&#39;ll work at the intersection of engineering, manufacturing, and operations, helping ensure products are built safely, efficiently, and at the highest standards of quality and reliability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make the tech that enables the chips in devices which improve lives around the world. We do this with an eye to the future, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible through cutting-edge innovation, and driving the next wave of technological breakthroughs that shape how we live, work, and connect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;To learn more about ASM, find us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.asm.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;asm.com&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/asm/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ASMOfficialCompany&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/asmofficialcompany/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/ASMofficialco&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/c/ASM_Official&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;ASM is an equal opportunity employer and considers qualified applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, age, nationality, social or ethnic origin, sexual orientation, gender, gender identify or expression, marital status, pregnancy, political affiliation, disability, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Architect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job&#39;s mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In support of ASM’s growth ambition and digital transformation strategy, there is a need to further improve and leverage data as a foundation for business value, operational scalability, analytics, process intelligence, automation and Artificial Intelligence. Across new product introductions, to manufacturing, to services and spares, the Data Architect links business operations, data platforms and technologies through a clear data architecture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Data Architect will be part of ASM’s Global Digital Transformation organization, within the Data &amp;amp; AI Intelligence capability. The architect will translate business priorities into scalable data architecture, and practical data solutions required to support ASM’s next phase of growth. In short, the architect will own the enterprise data architecture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Data Architect has a healthy degree of business acumen and is driven to understand how ASM operates. ASM is growing fast, and we are searching for a Data Architect who can help us to scale up and enable business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be working on&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc12276054&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc483484630&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own ASM’s Data Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and govern ASM&#39;s Enterprise Data Architecture Framework, including reference architecture, standards, guardrails and reusable playbooks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define how key platforms such as Databricks, SAP, Teamcenter, Salesforce and Celonis fit together in ASM’s target data architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive architectural consistency, reuse and simplification across all data platforms and business domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and reduce data architecture debt, duplicate capabilities, inconsistent data models and unnecessary platform fragmentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead architecture reviews, and peer reviews to ensure solution designs follow enterprise data architecture standards and deliver measurable business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design Trusted and AI-Ready Data Foundations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define architectural patterns for data products, integration, interoperability and data sharing across domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design trusted data foundations supporting analytics, business intelligence, machine learning, GenAI, Agentic AI, process intelligence and automation use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design scalable, secure, reusable, and cost-effective data architectures across lakehouse, warehouse, data lake, streaming, near-real-time, event-driven, operational, and analytical platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed security and compliance by design (classification, retention, trade compliance, access etc.) in partnership with Cyber Security, AI Governance, Enterprise Architecture and Legal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure architecture-by-design for data quality, consistency, accuracy, completeness, lineage, integrity, observability, auditability, and explainability across all layers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner, Influence and Innovate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with manufacturing, supply chain, engineering, quality, services, and other teams to translate priorities into scalable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Digital Transformation Business Partners to translate business outcomes, process needs, analytical needs, and value opportunities into scalable and reusable data architecture solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure architecture decisions are practical to adopt by the various teams, including documentation, and reusable templates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be a Subject Matter Expert&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the establishing of the vision for managing data as a business asset, and to maximize the return on data assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate emerging technologies and industry trends to continuously evolve ASM&#39;s data and AI capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the fostering of the creation of a data-driven culture, related competencies and data literacy across ASM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc12276055&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc12276056&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc12276058&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc483484637&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc357594604&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc12276059&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc483484638&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc482782340&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc482782242&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc482271968&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A degree in data science, information technology, computer science, mathematics, engineering, business administration, or a related field. Relevant professional training or certifications are desired but not required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Relevant certifications in Databricks, data architecture, enterprise architecture, data management, AI/ML platforms, data governance, or Agile are preferred, but not required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc357594605&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc12276060&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc483484639&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc482782341&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc482782243&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc482271969&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; and skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must have (required)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of data architecture and solutioning experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on experience in multiple competency areas related to data and analytics, such as data products, lakehouse architecture, data engineering, business intelligence, semantic models, data governance, and data quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of data engineering concepts and technologies, including SQL, Python, Spark-based processing, orchestration and metadata-driven engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of data governance, metadata management, cataloging, lineage, data contracts, data quality, classification, access control, retention, auditability, and responsible AI principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work with complex and diverse data sources, including structured, semi-structured, unstructured, streaming, sensor, equipment, and operational data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Databricks and cloud platforms (e.g. AWS/Azure/Google Cloud).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A drive to understand our business operations and commercial products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Action-oriented mindset, with the ability to move quickly while maintaining architecture discipline and governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to collaborate and coordinate with multiple teams, stakeholders and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder engagement and communication skills, with the ability to explain complex technical topics to business leaders, product teams, engineers, and others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good coaching and influencing skills, with the ability to guide architecture decisions, mentor technical teams, facilitate design discussions, and build data architecture maturity across ASM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outcome-driven mindset with focus on business value, adoption, reuse, scalability, speed, cost efficiency, and measurable impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired (not required)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Teamcenter, Salesforce, SAP systems (e.g. SAP S4 HANA), Celonis, Incorta, or Microsoft PowerBI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a semiconductor or high-tech manufacturing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make the tech that enables the chips in devices which improve lives around the world. We do this with an eye to the future, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible through cutting-edge innovation, and driving the next wave of technological breakthroughs that shape how we live, work, and connect.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make the tech that enables the chips in devices which improve lives around the world. We do this with an eye to the future, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible through cutting-edge innovation, and driving the next wave of technological breakthroughs that shape how we live, work, and connect.&lt;/p&gt;
