&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;___1qwroh2 fl43uef f19n0e5&quot; data-lexical-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Job&#39;s mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;em class=&quot;___11wyd0v f1j4dglz&quot; data-lexical-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;As a Principal Engineer – IQ Operations Focus at ASM, you will provide senior technical and operational leadership for installation qualification activities supporting the Intel Arizona Field Service organization. This role drives disciplined execution of IQ schedules, resource plans, operational reporting, data governance, and cross-functional business processes. You will work across Field Service management, module leadership, installation teams, Global Operations, Quality, Safety, business support, and customer stakeholders.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;___1qwroh2 fl43uef f19n0e5&quot; data-lexical-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What you will be working on&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;___14cu5j8 fdgang7 f1hu3pq6 f19f4twv fuxrj8o&quot;&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Coordinate IQ operational activities across supported Tier-1 customer modules, maintaining visibility to schedules, milestones, dependencies, resource requirements, and customer commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Develop project plans, readiness checkpoints, labor scenarios, risk registers, action ownership, due dates, and recovery plans for priority tools and qualification activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Support IQCD reviews and provide clear updates on tool status, parts constraints, qualification progress, resource gaps, and open actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Collect, consolidate, validate, and report customer and ASM operational data supporting IQ performance, chamber status, IQ cost, safety, resource planning, and related KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Maintain and improve Power BI dashboards and recurring reports, ensuring timely refresh, data accuracy, traceability, and decision-ready presentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Maintain IQ status and resource information in approved Power Apps, SharePoint, Excel, and related reporting environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Support weekly IQ labor planning and Names-in-Frames alignment with Field Service Managers, module owners, and Global Operations; identify and escalate resource or readiness constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;8&quot;&gt;Support service-order and activity processes using SAP, SAP S/4HANA, WFM, and Field Service Management, including order creation, assignments, labor review, and status maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;9&quot;&gt;Maintain ISR and support accurate warranty, installation, qualification, and service-business records.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;10&quot;&gt;Facilitate recurring project and operational reviews with concise updates on progress, risks, resource use, decisions required, and recovery plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;11&quot;&gt;Align ASM and customer stakeholders on IQ priorities, project status, milestones, and commitments; drive action closure and timely escalation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;12&quot;&gt;Analyze operational data to identify recurring issues, execution risks, and opportunities for standardization, automation, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;13&quot;&gt;Document standard work, data sources, system access, process ownership, reporting frequency, and backup coverage to strengthen operational continuity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;___1qwroh2 fl43uef f19n0e5&quot; data-lexical-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;___14cu5j8 fdgang7 f1hu3pq6 f19f4twv fuxrj8o&quot;&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in engineering, materials science, operations, information systems, business, project management, or a related technical field preferred; equivalent technical education and directly relevant semiconductor experience may be considered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;8+ years of experience in semiconductor field service, capital equipment, manufacturing, technical operations, project management, or a related environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience coordinating complex installation, qualification, or operational projects in a customer-facing, high-accountability environment.&lt;/li&gt;
