&lt;li&gt;Proficient in operational excellence and problem-solving methodologies, including FMEA, 8D, SPC, DMAIC, GR&amp;amp;R, Six Sigma, and Design of Experiments (DOE).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
