&lt;li&gt;Own EMC/EMI, grounding, CE/UL, SEMI, and global compliance strategies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor principal engineers and develop organizational technical capability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
