&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Senior Principal Engineer, Mechanical Engineer (DFx, Chemistry, Gas Delivery, Mechanical)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job&#39;s mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At ASM, our technology powers the most advanced semiconductor devices in the world, and our people are at the heart of that innovation. We are hiring Engineers of various experience levels across multiple KPUs, product lines, and technology domains. Joining ASM gives you the opportunity to join a global organization where the complexity of the challenges matches the scale of the impact. As part of our Common Engineering/ DFx&amp;nbsp;team, you’ll operate at the intersection of cutting-edge technology, engineering, field operations, and customer environments, ensuring our technologies perform reliably from early concept through high-volume manufacturing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Challenge&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll apply your expertise to the design and development of next-generation semiconductor equipment within ASM’s Common Engineering/ DFx team. Working alongside experienced engineers, you’ll contribute to cutting-edge mechanical, gas delivery systems while building deep industry knowledge. This role offers hands-on technical challenges, mentorship, and a clear pathway for growth. You’ll also play a key role across the full product lifecycle, from development and first builds through customer qualification and scale. Depending on your background, you may focus on system-level troubleshooting, new product introduction, automation, or driving performance improvements in the field.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be working on&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to design and development of semiconductor systems, including common modules design, gas delivery, supply chain design, and data analytics. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage project timelines, budgets, and resources while ensuring compliance with safety and quality standards. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams in manufacturing, supply chain, and quality to align on goals and deliverables. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical support and troubleshooting for modules such as gas delivery, test requirements definition, equipment and automation systems, driving root cause analysis and resolution. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own BOM release and maintenance, ensuring accurate documentation and reporting for stakeholders. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous improvement initiatives and stay current with industry trends and emerging technologies. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare comprehensive design documentation for manufacturing and testing of prototypes and production products. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a module and system-level technical expert, supporting complex semiconductor equipment in both development labs and customer&amp;nbsp;fabs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose and resolve advanced system, hardware, and process issues, including escalations beyond standard support&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive root cause analysis (RCCA) and implement sustainable solutions across tools, sites, and product lines&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support new product introduction (NPI), including early builds, lab validation, and ramp to high-volume manufacturing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead or support first-in-fab (Alpha / Beta) deployments, Lab tools, installation, start-up, and qualification&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate field and customer feedback into design, performance, and reliability improvements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to yield improvement, tool performance, and uptime in demanding&amp;nbsp;fab&amp;nbsp;environments&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and share best practices, technical documentation, and global standards&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with hardware, software, controls, and process engineering teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead / Support global initiatives, mentor engineers and represent ASM in customer-facing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s, Master’s or PhD degree in Engineering (mechanical, electrical, chemistry, gas delivery, systems, or similar disciplines); Data analytics/AI agentic is a plus. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in semiconductor equipment or complex technical environments&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of CE, NFPA, Semi S2-95, and other relevant standards for semiconductor manufacturing equipment. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving mindset with system-level thinking&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on approach and ability to connect theory with real-world system behavior&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical skills (DOE, data analysis, structured problem solving)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working across global teams and time zones&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication&amp;nbsp;skills, including customer-facing interactions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel internationally (~20%)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What sets you apart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across a broad range of technologies (plasma, vacuum, gas delivery, software, hardware integration, data analytics)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate where product development meets real-world&amp;nbsp;fab&amp;nbsp;performance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High visibility and impact across engineering, operations, supply chain, and customers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make the tech that enables the chips in devices which improve lives around the world. We do this with an eye to the future, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible through cutting-edge innovation, and driving the next wave of technological breakthroughs that shape how we live, work, and connect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;To learn more about ASM, find us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.asm.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;asm.com&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/asm/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ASMOfficialCompany&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/asmofficialcompany/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/ASMofficialco&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/c/ASM_Official&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;ASM is an equal opportunity employer and considers qualified applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, age, nationality, social or ethnic origin, sexual orientation, gender, gender identify or expression, marital status, pregnancy, political affiliation, disability, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job&#39;s mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As an &lt;strong&gt;R&amp;amp;D Principal Engineer, Process Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; at ASM, you will play a key role in developing and optimizing advanced semiconductor deposition processes that enable next-generation devices.&lt;br&gt;You will work hands-on with state-of-the-art processing and analytical equipment, contributing to innovation in &lt;strong&gt;ALD/PEALD, PECVD, CVD, Epitaxy, oxidation, annealing, and curing processes&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;This role offers the opportunity to turn scientific ideas into impactful technologies through process development, customer engagement, and intellectual property creation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be working on&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Researching, developing, and optimizing thin film deposition processes, with a focus on &lt;strong&gt;metal and dielectric films using PEALD and related technologies&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Designing and executing complex experiments using&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Design of Experiments (DOE)&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Response Surface Methodology (RSM)&lt;/strong&gt;, and interpreting experimental results.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Developing new film materials and processes for emerging semiconductor applications based on strong chemistry and materials science fundamentals.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Actively troubleshooting process and equipment issues through hands-on engagement.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Participating in and driving structured technical problem-solving using scientific methodologies and industry tools.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Collaborating with customers and central marketing to define requirements and execute customer demonstrations.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Supporting product transfer to customers by delivering demonstrations, training field service teams, creating technical documentation, and traveling to customer sites (up to&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;10%&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Authoring technical papers and contributing to&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;intellectual property (IP)&lt;/strong&gt; generation related to process and technology development.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PhD with 10+ years&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;MS degree with 14+ years of relevant industry experience&lt;/strong&gt; in Chemical Engineering, Materials Science, Electrical Engineering, Physics, or a related field.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Hands-on experience with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;PEALD, ALD, PECVD, CVD, Epitaxy&lt;/strong&gt;, or other thin film deposition technologies.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong understanding of thin film deposition principles and semiconductor process development.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience designing and characterizing deposition processes using first principles and experimental design techniques.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ability to independently manage complex process development activities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Excellent communication skills in &lt;strong&gt;English and Korean&lt;/strong&gt;, with the ability to clearly explain complex technical concepts.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What sets you apart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;electrical characterization techniques for CMOS devices&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience integrating metal and/or dielectric films into&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;FEOL and BEOL process flows&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Hands-on experience with materials characterization techniques such as&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;XPS, SIMS, AFM, XRD, TEM, SEM, Raman, or ellipsometry&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience authoring technical publications and/or patents in the semiconductor industry.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong collaboration skills with customers, field teams, and cross-functional stakeholders.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make the tech that enables the chips in devices which improve lives around the world. We do this with an eye to the future, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible through cutting-edge innovation, and driving the next wave of technological breakthroughs that shape how we live, work, and connect.&lt;/p&gt;
