&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Principal Field Process Engineer (FPE)&lt;/strong&gt; is a &lt;strong&gt;senior individual contributor&lt;/strong&gt; within ASM’s &lt;strong&gt;Key Account organization (Global Sales &amp;amp; Services)&lt;/strong&gt; and serves as the &lt;strong&gt;technical authority and escalation owner&lt;/strong&gt; for customer‑facing process applications. This role operates with &lt;strong&gt;high autonomy&lt;/strong&gt;, leading complex &lt;strong&gt;new product introductions (NPI), on‑site process development, and HVM transfers&lt;/strong&gt;, while acting as the primary technical interface between ASM Business Units and customer process teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be working on&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own technical delivery and escalation&lt;/strong&gt; for NPI of advanced deposition processes and hardware (thermal ALD, plasma ALD, Area Selective Deposition).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Lead complex troubleshooting, root cause analysis, and cross‑functional resolution with customers, Business Units, and field teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Drive on‑site process and hardware development, including DOE‑based experiments and continuous improvement initiatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Identify and advance new ASM technology and film opportunities aligned to customer roadmaps.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Lead process transfer to HVM fabs and develop/transfer &lt;strong&gt;Best Known Methods (BKMs)&lt;/strong&gt; to service and manufacturing teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Capture and feedback technical learnings to influence future ASM hardware, process, and qualification packages.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;M.S. or PhD in Chemistry, Chemical Engineering, Materials Science, Physics, or related field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;7–10 years of experience in thin‑film deposition (ALD).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong expertise in semiconductor device integration, vacuum systems, film metrology, and structured problem solving.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Proven ability to independently design experiments, manage escalations, and influence without authority.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Excellent technical communication skills and strong IP awareness.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Flexibility to travel and support extended hours during qualifications or escalations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What sets you apart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Hands‑on experience with &lt;strong&gt;ASM ALD, PEALD, PECVD, Epitaxy, or Vertical Furnace LPCVD&lt;/strong&gt; equipment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success optimizing deposition processes in development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading customer-facing technical discussions or escalations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coordinating cross-functional action plans during escalations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make the tech that enables the chips in devices which improve lives around the world. We do this with an eye to the future, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible through cutting-edge innovation, and driving the next wave of technological breakthroughs that shape how we live, work, and connect.&lt;/p&gt;
