&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;University &amp;amp; Academic Partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute ASM’s university recruiting plan across Asia with clear focus on practical outcomes and hiring impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop trusted relationships with universities, professors, labs, career centers, and student groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build targeted engagement plans for key STEM disciplines including Electrical Engineering, Mechanical Engineering, Chemical Engineering, Materials Science, Physics, and Computer Science.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain relationships with PhD advisors, researchers, post-doctoral communities, and university leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities for strategic collaboration including guest lectures, technical talks, capstone projects, research partnerships, scholarships, competitions, and sponsorships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Early Career Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business hiring needs into a practical early-career roadmap that can be executed across Asia.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead internship, co-op, new college graduate (NCG), and graduate hiring programs across Asia.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create fresh and authentic ways to engage students and young professionals, including campus events, social content, employee stories, technical talks, and talent communities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with business leaders to identify future capability needs and build sustainable talent pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive intern-to-full-time conversion strategies and talent community engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talent Attraction Activation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Activate university-focused talent attraction plans across Asia in alignment with global TA Center of Excellence guidance and MarCom standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Localize campus messaging for engineering and STEM audiences, using approved employer brand frameworks and content from the appropriate internal owners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent ASM at university career fairs, industry conferences, technical symposiums, student events, and recruitment campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Marketing, Communications, TA Center of Excellence, and local TA teams to increase ASM’s visibility within target university and early-career talent communities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source candidate-relevant stories, campus insights, and recruiting needs from the market, then coordinate with MarCom or COE owners for final messaging, creative assets, and broader employer brand campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
