&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job&#39;s mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Are you passionate about shaping the responsible adoption of AI, Generative AI and Agentic AI in a global high-tech environment? Do you want to help ensure that AI solutions are trustworthy, compliant, secure, human-centered and value-driven? If so, we invite you to join ASM’s Global Digital Transformation organization as an AI Governance Specialist.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:794,&amp;quot;335559731&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:19,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:10}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;At ASM, Global Digital Transformation is accelerating the responsible use of data, AI and digital capabilities to strengthen business outcomes, innovation, operational excellence and employee experience. As AI rapidly evolves from predictive models to Generative AI, copilots and increasingly autonomous AI agents, strong governance is essential to balance value creation with safety, trust, compliance and resilience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:794,&amp;quot;335559731&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:19,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:10}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:794,&amp;quot;335559731&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:19,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:10}&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW103122833 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW103122833 BCX8&quot;&gt;You will play a critical role in operationalizing ASM’s AI Governance program: translating responsible AI principles, regulatory expectations and enterprise risk appetite into practical policies, controls, review &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW103122833 BCX8&quot;&gt;mechanisms&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW103122833 BCX8&quot;&gt; and adoption guidance. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackedChange SCXW103122833 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW103122833 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW103122833 BCX8&quot;&gt;You will support governance across the AI lifecycle, including AI use-case intake, risk classification, model and solution review, GenAI acceptable-use guidance, AI agent oversight, third-party AI assessment, security and control assurance, monitoring, reporting and continuous improvement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW103122833 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW103122833 BCX8&quot;&gt;You will collaborate globally with Data &amp;amp; AI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackedChange SCXW103122833 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW103122833 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW103122833 BCX8&quot;&gt; 