&lt;div class=&quot;x_x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;The Senior Director, M&amp;amp;A Integration leads the planning and execution of integration activities associated with acquisitions, strategic investments, and business combinations across a global semiconductor equipment company. This role is responsible for ensuring acquired organizations, technologies, products, and teams are successfully integrated into the business while maintaining operational continuity and delivering on the strategic objectives of each transaction.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;Working closely with executive leadership, business units, engineering, operations, supply chain, product management, HR, finance, and IT, this leader serves as the central point of coordination for integration efforts from pre-close planning through full operational integration.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
