&lt;div class=&quot;x_x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integration Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead integration planning and execution for acquisitions, technology purchases, and strategic investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and manage integration plans, timelines, milestones, and governance processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate cross-functional integration teams across engineering, operations, supply chain, product management, quality, HR, finance, and IT.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and address risks that could impact business continuity, customer commitments, employee retention, or integration progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide regular updates and recommendations to executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology &amp;amp; Product Integration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineering and product leaders to integrate technologies, product portfolios, and development roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align hardware, software, manufacturing, and service organizations to support business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support integration of intellectual property, product platforms, and engineering processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure acquired technologies are effectively incorporated into long-term product and technology strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
