&lt;div class=&quot;x_x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Integration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead integration of manufacturing, supply chain, procurement, quality, and service organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and implement opportunities to simplify processes, eliminate duplication, and improve operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support manufacturing footprint, supplier, and business systems integration activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish metrics to monitor integration progress and operational performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organizational Integration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with business leaders and HR to integrate teams, organizational structures, and operating models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop retention plans for key technical, product, and leadership talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support change management and communication efforts throughout the integration process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster alignment and collaboration across newly integrated organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transaction Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Corporate Development and business leaders during due diligence to assess integration complexity, risks, and resource requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop Day 1 and transition plans for acquisitions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide integration input during transaction planning and deal execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support post-close reviews and lessons learned to improve future integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
