&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make the tech that enables the chips in devices which improve lives around the world. We do this with an eye to the future, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible through cutting-edge innovation, and driving the next wave of technological breakthroughs that shape how we live, work, and connect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;To learn more about ASM, find us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.asm.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;asm.com&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/asm/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ASMOfficialCompany&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/asmofficialcompany/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/ASMofficialco&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/c/ASM_Official&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;ASM is an equal opportunity employer and considers qualified applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, age, nationality, social or ethnic origin, sexual orientation, gender, gender identify or expression, marital status, pregnancy, political affiliation, disability, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The primary responsibility of this role is to manage and drive the process engineering function for a key product group in the ASM’s Atomic Layer Deposition (ALD) technology with a focus on results. This will require a strong leader that is highly skilled in people,&amp;nbsp;process&amp;nbsp;and technology across ASM’s ALD operations. Further, the role requires someone who is not only skilled in R&amp;amp;D/Innovation, development,&amp;nbsp;engineering&amp;nbsp;and design for manufacturability, but also someone who is adept at process and organization, continuous improvement and working with and managing people across cultural dimensions in developing and delivering the ALD technology roadmap. A persistent approach to Product Life Cycle (PLC) will be&amp;nbsp;required&amp;nbsp;to achieve strong engagement with the team,&amp;nbsp;develop&amp;nbsp;and implement new processes and organization, and manage the team to achieve PLC deliverables and drive projects to completion, exceeding&amp;nbsp;timelines&amp;nbsp;and budgetary&amp;nbsp;objectives. This position&amp;nbsp;facilitates&amp;nbsp;getting ASM products to market as quickly as possible by directly influencing and communicating with key customers to solve their high value problems. The successful candidate will have&amp;nbsp;a track record&amp;nbsp;of recruiting and&amp;nbsp;developing industry leading process engineering teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
