&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Position Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join ASM&#39;s journey to enable the next era of semiconductor innovation. As Product Quality Director/Sr. Director, you will lead quality and reliability for cutting-edge equipment platforms supporting advanced process technologies. Reporting to the VP, Global Quality, you will work at the intersection of engineering innovation and customer success, driving quality excellence from new technology development through global deployment. This role provides a unique opportunity to influence the development and commercialization of breakthrough semiconductor technologies, solve complex engineering challenges, and ensure the robust performance of products that enable the world&#39;s most advanced AI, logic, memory, and high-performance computing applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Line Quality Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Serve as the Single Point of Contact (SPOC) for all product quality matters for assigned product lines&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;Coach and mentor teams for root cause investigations on issues leveraging failure analysis and best practices, e.g. 5 Why&#39;s, fishbone diagram etc.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;Develop and execute product quality strategies aligned with business objectives in alignment with business units.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous improvement initiatives to improve quality, reliability, and customer satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and report product quality performance through established KPIs and scorecards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Product Introduction (NPI) Quality Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Quality engagement throughout the NPI lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, communicate, and execute Quality Roles &amp;amp; Responsibilities (R&amp;amp;R) within product development programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure Design for Quality and Reliability principles are incorporated into new product development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support design reviews, qualification activities, and product release readiness assessments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish product quality requirements and acceptance criteria during development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Lifecycle Quality Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the Quality Owner within the Product Lifecycle Control (PLC) process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and maintain critical quality deliverables including:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product and System FMEA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Critical Parts Identification and Control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reliability Plans and Assessments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product Risk Registers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quality Plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure lifecycle quality requirements are met from concept through end-of-life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Reliability Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define product reliability requirements and objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop reliability verification and validation strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish reliability measurement methodologies, performance metrics, and qualification criteria.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead reliability growth and improvement activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain reliability apportionment models to support system reliability targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze field reliability data and drive corrective actions to improve product robustness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Quality and Escalation Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Top-X customer quality issues and Tier 1 escalations for assigned product lines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Act as the primary quality interface for strategic customers&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional teams in containment, root cause analysis, corrective actions, and closure activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide executive-level communication and status updates for critical customer issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive customer satisfaction and quality improvement initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk Management and Continuous Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply risk-based methodologies to identify and mitigate product quality risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate structured problem-solving activities using methodologies such as:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8D&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DMAIC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;FMEA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fault Tree Analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Root Cause Analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive systemic corrective and preventive actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion quality culture and operational excellence initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Engineering, Quality, Reliability, or related technical discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master&#39;s degree preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;15+ years of experience in Quality, Reliability, Engineering, or Semiconductor Equipment Manufacturing.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in New Product Introduction (NPI) and Product Lifecycle Management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading customer quality escalations and complex cross-functional problem-solving efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of semiconductor equipment systems and reliability engineering principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product Quality Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reliability Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;FMEA Facilitation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Statistical Analysis and SPC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Root Cause Analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product Qualification and Validation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reliability Modeling and Apportionment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Quality Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Risk Assessment and Mitigation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quality Management Systems (QMS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional leadership and influencing skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent executive communication and presentation capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to drive alignment across engineering, operations, and business organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-focused mindset with a bias toward action and issue resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic thinker with strong analytical and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires approximately 40% travel internationally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make the tech that enables the chips in devices which improve lives around the world. We do this with an eye to the future, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible through cutting-edge innovation, and driving the next wave of technological breakthroughs that shape how we live, work, and connect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;To learn more about ASM, find us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.asm.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;asm.com&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/asm/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ASMOfficialCompany&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/asmofficialcompany/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/ASMofficialco&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/c/ASM_Official&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
