&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;ASM is an equal opportunity employer and considers qualified applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, age, nationality, social or ethnic origin, sexual orientation, gender, gender identify or expression, marital status, pregnancy, political affiliation, disability, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job&#39;s mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us to turn process intelligence into measurable business impact. As Senior Engineer II, Process Intelligence and Value Realization, you will work across business and technology teams to uncover opportunities, improve enterprise processes, and translate data-driven insights into measurable operational and financial outcomes. You will also help shape how ASM uses process intelligence, AI, and automation to make smarter decisions and continuously improve the way we work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be working on&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and prioritize opportunities to improve processes, productivity, cost, working capital, compliance, and service performance across business functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn process intelligence insights into clear business cases, improvement initiatives, and measurable value realization plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead continuous improvement initiatives, from root cause analysis and opportunity prioritization through execution and benefits validation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Business Process Data Owners and business leaders to establish process performance baselines, targets, improvement roadmaps, and governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interpret process mining and process intelligence insights to identify bottlenecks, process deviations, rework, value leakage, compliance risks, and automation opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex analytical findings into clear recommendations and actions for business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to apply AI, generative AI, agentic AI, and intelligent automation to improve process performance and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define business requirements, success measures, and expected outcomes for AI-enabled process optimization initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Data &amp;amp; AI Intelligence and technology teams to translate business requirements into scalable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply process intelligence tools, including Celonis, to support process analysis, use case development, and value realization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate relevant capabilities across enterprise platforms, including Celonis, SAP, Databricks, and Microsoft, to identify opportunities that support business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present insights and recommendations to senior stakeholders and support process governance and value realization forums.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop repeatable methodologies, playbooks, and frameworks that strengthen ASM&#39;s internal process intelligence and value realization capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum Bachelor’s degree in engineering, business administration, finance, operations management, supply chain, information systems, data analytics, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 8 years of experience in business transformation, operational excellence, process improvement, consulting, or value realization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Celonis Process Intelligence, process mining, process optimization, or related capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant experience with SAP Signavio process tools or comparable process intelligence and process mining platforms will also be considered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading cross-functional process improvement or transformation initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing business cases and tracking measurable operational or financial benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with senior stakeholders in complex organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of enterprise business processes and process improvement approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using process mining or process intelligence approaches to identify and prioritize improvement opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate analytical findings into clear business recommendations and actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively across business, data, and technology teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What sets you apart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience identifying or developing AI, generative AI, agentic AI, or intelligent automation use cases for enterprise processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with enterprise technology platforms such as SAP S/4HANA, Databricks, Salesforce, Teamcenter, or Power BI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Lean Six Sigma, continuous improvement, change management, process governance, or execution management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to large-scale business or digital transformation programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the semiconductor or advanced manufacturing industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make the tech that enables the chips in devices which improve lives around the world. We do this with an eye to the future, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible through cutting-edge innovation, and driving the next wave of technological breakthroughs that shape how we live, work, and connect.&lt;/p&gt;
