&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job’s mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As ASM accelerates its global PLM modernization journey, you’ll play a pivotal role in shaping how our engineers design, build, and innovate. You will guide the evolution of enterprise Teamcenter solutions that power our product development and manufacturing workflows across a global engineering community. Your work will help streamline collaboration, sharpen data quality, and bring next‑generation semiconductor technology to life faster and more reliably.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be working on&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with engineering and manufacturing teams to translate business needs into scalable PLM and Teamcenter solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support user adoption by guiding use cases, partnering with vendors, and driving enhancements that elevate product capabilities and business processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities and challenges across current workflows and help shape the PLM technology strategy and roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain, optimize, and evolve Teamcenter configurations, processes, integrations, and supporting tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex, multi‑team technology initiatives that deliver measurable improvements in efficiency and engineering experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply project management practices that help teams work more effectively and collaboratively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use your understanding of PLM architecture—workflows, APIs, runtime behavior, and system characteristics—to build scalable, reliable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage PLM processes and tools in an electro‑mechanical environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive integrations and automation with adjacent business systems including Oracle and Agile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and monitor PLM data metrics to maintain stability, data accuracy, and smooth operation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with cross‑functional users to gather insights and enhance product development, manufacturing, and operations workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and enhance Engineering Change processes to support quality and faster cycle times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define product structure and Bill of Material (BOM) standards that ensure consistent, high‑quality data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion continuous improvement across PLM processes and lifecycle governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with developers to scope and implement new features that support evolving business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver training, workshops, and guidance to promote PLM best practices and adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with industry trends and emerging technologies to drive ongoing improvement within PLM and engineering systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS + 8 years, OR MS + 4 years, OR PhD with relevant experience in Mechanical, Industrial, or related engineering fields.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience implementing Siemens Teamcenter PLM solutions including configuration, setup, upgrades, and solution design.&lt;/li&gt;
