&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;___1qwroh2 fl43uef f19n0e5&quot; data-lexical-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Job&#39;s mission&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Field Process Engineer, you will be responsible to understand our customers’ needs and provide process support and subsequent implementation with alignment with BUs to ensure we deliver service and value to meet even exceed customers’ expectation. As a key driver of business success, you will play a vital role in strengthening and enabling business success through developing and improving processes run on our tool sets at customer sites. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;___1qwroh2 fl43uef f19n0e5&quot; data-lexical-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Job Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;___14cu5j8 fdgang7 f1hu3pq6 f19f4twv fuxrj8o&quot;&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Evaluate, understand and identify current customer needs, while also anticipating future needs and building long-term sustainable relationship and solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Drive continuous improvement of the customer experience through team, process and support tool development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Drive and manage new product installs and subsequent process development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Leading new site start up and planning/risk assessment for readiness/execution successfully to get customer recognition and satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Define project scope and resource planning together with BU, escalate to Manager for resource gap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Support CS EE /Sales/BU as one team to success site base operation/service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;___1qwroh2 fl43uef f19n0e5&quot; data-lexical-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;___14cu5j8 fdgang7 f1hu3pq6 f19f4twv fuxrj8o&quot;&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Master Degree or above.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Solid technical knowledge and deep business perspective in the Semiconductor industry, preferably in CVD/ALD/Furnace/EPI related.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Strong industry experience that support complex instrumentation, applications and informatics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Ability to work in a team environment with tight deadlines and multiple priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Ability to collaborate with others to find the best solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Good command of English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;職務概要&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Field Process Engineerとして、世界最先端の半導体メーカーと協力しながら、次世代デバイスを支えるプロセス開発・最適化を担っていただきます。 お客様の技術課題を解決し、新製品の立ち上げから量産適用までをリードすることで、半導体業界の最前線で技術革新に貢献できるポジションです。ASMのグローバルチームやBusiness Unitと連携しながら、高度なプロセス技術を習得し、専門性をさらに高めることができます。 主な業務内容&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;___14cu5j8 fdgang7 f1hu3pq6 f19f4twv fuxrj8o&quot;&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;世界トップクラスの半導体メーカーに対するプロセス開発・最適化支援&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;ALD、CVD、Epitaxyなど先端成膜技術を活用した技術課題の解決&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;新製品・新装置の導入および立ち上げプロジェクトの推進&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;顧客、営業、開発部門と連携したプロセス改善・性能向上活動&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;データ解析を通じた歩留まり、生産性、装置性能の向上&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;国内外のASMエンジニアとの協業による最先端技術の展開&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;将来の技術ニーズを見据えた新たなソリューション提案&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;求める人物像&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;___14cu5j8 fdgang7 f1hu3pq6 f19f4twv fuxrj8o&quot;&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;修士以上の学位をお持ちの方&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;半導体プロセスまたは半導体製造装置に関する経験をお持ちの方&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;ALD、CVD、Furnace、Epitaxyなどの成膜プロセス経験者歓迎&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;技術的な課題解決にやりがいを感じる方&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;顧客や社内関係者と協力しながら成果を生み出せる方&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;英語を使ったグローバルな環境でチャレンジしたい方&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
