&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Electrical, Mechanical, Mechatronics, Chemical Engineering, or related field.&lt;/li&gt;
