&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Collaborate with global R&amp;amp;D, Product Marketing, and Service teams to drive continuous product improvement and translate customer requirements into product and technology development inputs&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Support alignment between customer needs and ASM business strategy&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
