&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience in &lt;strong&gt;Epitaxy (Epi), thin film / deposition processes (e.g., CVD, ALD, diffusion)&lt;/strong&gt; or related semiconductor wafer processing technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in semiconductor &lt;strong&gt;device manufacturing, process development, or capital equipment industry&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in roles such as &lt;strong&gt;Process Engineer, Integration Engineer, Application Engineer, KAT, or Technical Customer Support&lt;/strong&gt; is highly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of semiconductor &lt;strong&gt;process integration and high-volume manufacturing environments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to solve &lt;strong&gt;complex technical problems&lt;/strong&gt;, including managing customer escalations and driving root cause analysis and corrective actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting &lt;strong&gt;NPI, process qualification, or technology transfer activities&lt;/strong&gt; at customer sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and data-driven problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills to engage effectively with customer R&amp;amp;D, manufacturing, and internal global teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in both Korean and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What sets you apart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience working directly with key semiconductor accounts (e.g., Samsung, SK hynix)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Hands-on experience with Epi / thin film / diffusion deposition systems&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience leading NPI programs or customer technology evaluations&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ability to influence cross-functional teams and drive technical strategy&lt;/div&gt;
