&lt;p&gt;We make the tech that enables the chips in devices which improve lives around the world. We do this with an eye to the future, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible through cutting-edge innovation, and driving the next wave of technological breakthroughs that shape how we live, work, and connect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;To learn more about ASM, find us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.asm.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;asm.com&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/asm/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ASMOfficialCompany&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/asmofficialcompany/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/ASMofficialco&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/c/ASM_Official&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;ASM is an equal opportunity employer and considers qualified applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, age, nationality, social or ethnic origin, sexual orientation, gender, gender identify or expression, marital status, pregnancy, political affiliation, disability, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our Atomic Layer Deposition (ALD) Chamber Engineering team is seeking innovative and driven and experienced Mechanical Engineers to join their teams. Our ALD and team is at the forefront of developing cutting-edge technologies. As a Mechanical Engineer at ASM, you will contribute to designing, developing, and optimizing high-precision equipment. Collaborating with cross-disciplinary teams, you will play a critical role in solving complex engineering challenges, ensuring product reliability, and driving technological advancements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Apply sound engineering principles, product specifications and research data to create designs for systems and products for semiconductor industry.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Perform engineering calculations including&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;structural, thermal and fluid dynamics problems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Create and revise Creo&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;border: none;&quot;&gt;Parametric&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;CAD models and detail drawings, ranging in complexity from simple piece parts to large assemblies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Determine feasibility of product proposals, resolve problems based on technical inputs and develop new designs maintaining product design safety criteria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Apply statistics to optimize and deliver “first time right” designs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Prepare product/system designs and related engineering documentation for the manufacturing and testing of prototype and production released products. The documentation shall be complete and easy to follow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Project management duties include report generation, schedule creation and maintenance, design reviews and interdepartmental coordination.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Provide assistance in establishing product configuration and structures on new products and features in both development and manufacturing environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Present and participate in design reviews for unique customer driven specials, product enhancements and other new designs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Create, manage and execute engineering project plans, including task scheduling with Gantt charts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;and resource and cost estimates,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Travel to customer sites/supplier sites to participate in technical discussions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Assist marketing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;and vendors in preparation of cost estimates dealing with nonstandard options, new system features and product enhancements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Support projects in conjunction with technical staff, managers and manufacturing groups. Support development, installation and testing of hardware to verify performance. Create test plans, verify and approve test procedures.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Interface with other organizations on new product updates and ensure a smooth transition of the product into the manufacturing cycle.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;Evaluate change requests and complete all aspects of engineering change orders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;Masters in Mechanical Engineering or related degree, PhD strongly preferred.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;Experience in &lt;span style=&quot;border: none;&quot;&gt;engineering, design, and development of complex mechanical systems including: reactors, vacuum chambers, gas delivery systems, pneumatics, water cooling circuits, and vacuum systems required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;Skills:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;Semiconductor capital equipment or heavy capital equipment preferred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #32363a;&quot;&gt;Deposition product knowledge a plus (CVD, ALD, EPI, PVD)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #32363a;&quot;&gt;Knowledgeable in the requirements for CE, NFPA, Semi S2-95 and other relevant standards as applicable to semiconductor manufacturing equipment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #32363a;&quot;&gt;Understanding of materials: metals, plastics, surface coatings and surface finishes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #32363a;&quot;&gt;Computer background in Microsoft applications,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;CREO&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #32363a;&quot;&gt;and AutoCAD.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;Proficiency in ASME Y14.5 and/or ISO 1101:2017 preferred geometric dimension and tolerance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #32363a;&quot;&gt;Has knowledge of best practices and how own area integrates with others; recommends product and process improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #32363a;&quot;&gt;Able to work with a diverse team to achieve requirements and specifications on complex projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #32363a;&quot;&gt;Capability to provide and maintain resource coordination and reporting, interfacing with other organizations and outside vendors on resource requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #32363a;&quot;&gt;A critical thinker with proven ability to create effective solutions to complex engineering problems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #32363a;&quot;&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication; ability to present design concepts to peers and management in a professional and effective manner.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #32363a;&quot;&gt;Ability to work in a team environment with aggressive deadlines and multiple priorities while maintaining a team player attitude.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;72&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #32363a;&quot;&gt;Perform self-inspection of all work and is responsible for ensuring that all work performed adheres to documentation requirements, company policies and procedures.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
