&lt;p&gt;You have an understanding of physics of semiconductor devices and/or characterization&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience working with metrology tools would be a plus&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You enjoy working in a fab / lab environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’d like to work closely with an international, innovative and hands-on team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are flexible in working times(early mornings / evenings / weekends)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have good communication skills in English and have a collaborative mindset&lt;/p&gt;
