&lt;p&gt;Our team develops new processes and applications in a vertical batch reactor for state-of-art integrated device flows. It is a chance to work in one of the most advanced scientific fields in the world and still seeing your inventions in tomorrow’s products out in the market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works with semiconductor processing equipment to research, develop and optimize processes focused on oxidation, annealing, curing, and deposition (CVD, ALD) of thin films&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develops new applications of thin films and processes in the areas of logic, memory, analog, power and MEMS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designs and conducts experiments, measurements and performs the interpretation of complex experimental output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Documents and publishes the learnings in internal and external communications and defines new standard recipes (BKM).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply expertise process experience to drive and guide new hardware and software development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works with customers and product marketing to understand and define requirements to successfully execute projects and demonstrations&lt;/li&gt;
