&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Specific experience in developing custom ML algorithms and models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in small and large datasets&lt;/li&gt;
