&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;In this role, you will develop control software for ASM’s PEALD/PECVD semiconductor equipment. You will design and implement software that is tightly integrated with real production equipment, playing a critical role in improving stability, productivity, and performance in semiconductor manufacturing environments.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
