&lt;p&gt;-Experience in semiconductor industry and working in fab environment&lt;br&gt;-Experience in equipment control software development for advanced industries&lt;br&gt;-Experience in OOP Language&lt;br&gt;-Experience with TwinCat or other EtherCAT master stack topology&lt;br&gt;-Familiarity with software engineering tools such as Jira, Git&lt;br&gt;-Experienced in development for TCP/IP, RS232, DeviceNet, EtherCAT communication&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
