&lt;li&gt;Integrate and support factory automation interfaces, including SECS/GEM and related industry protocols.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with automation teams to ensure reliable communication between manufacturing equipment and factory systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
