&lt;li&gt;Strong software development experience using C#.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in software development, preferably in a full-stack or systems-focused environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Semiconductor industry experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with factory automation systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SECS/GEM, GEM300, and EDA (Interface A) protocols.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Automated Material Handling Systems (AMHS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong troubleshooting, analytical, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
