&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master’s or PhD in Electrical and Electronics Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ast least 5 years of work experience as a System Engineer in a semiconductor equipment manufacturing company, with expertise in equipment electrical hardware design or development of units/systems like Reactor or Plasma Source, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Auto CAD technique and also in JMP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a fast-paced, team-oriented environment supporting a global customer base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A person with fundamental knowledge that enables learning about future processes and mechanisms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A person with basic knowledge and aptitude to grow into a system engineer in the future.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A person who has the motivation to develop into a system engineer in the future.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
