&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s Degree in engineering discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum 5 years of relevant experience preferably in Epitaxy (Epi) &lt;/strong&gt;process equipment in semiconductor equipment manufacturer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ALD/CVD, Etch is also considerable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in Japanese and business level communication skills in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel internationally. Depending on the product development cycle travel ranges from 25% to 50%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of semiconductor processing and device fabrication.&lt;/li&gt;
