&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior / &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; at ASM, you will join the Global Quality (GQ) team and collaborate with contract manufacturers, manufacturing sites, engineering, and field service teams to meet customer expectations. Your responsibilities include driving contract manufacturing / manufacturing quality improvements, addressing non-conformances, and implementing quality systems aligned with ASM’s technology roadmap. This role suits those with strong quality expertise, and a drive for continuous improvement in high-tech manufacturing.&lt;/p&gt;
