&lt;li&gt;Develop and optimize inspection plans, quality control methods, and workmanship standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct product audits as necessary prior to release for shipment, to confirm compliance with quality standards for customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support internal audits, external certification audits, and customer audits. Ensure timely closure of audit findings and continuous improvement actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct periodic ISO 9001 audits toward contract manufacturers and follow-up CAPA within given time frame.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
