&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in mechanical, Electrical or Electronic Engineering, Quality Engineering or other related disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in quality and manufacturing background&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ISO 9001 internal auditor / lead auditor certification preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possesses experience in internal audits, certification audits, and/or customer audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving and analytical skills and expertise in structured problem solving (8D methodology).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and interpersonal skills for cross-functional collaboration for internal facing and external facing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and manage multiple priorities in a dynamic environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
