&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;As a Senior Field Process Engineer, you play a central role in bringing ASM’s most advanced technologies to life at our customers’ fabs. You sit at the intersection of innovation and real‑world manufacturing, turning breakthrough science into high‑performance processes that help customers solve their toughest integration challenges. Your work strengthens ASM’s position as the industry’s trusted technology partner—driving successful NPIs, accelerating roadmap milestones, and shaping the next generation of semiconductor devices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be working on&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with customer and product teams to understand technology roadmaps, process flows, inflection points, and business challenges. Identify opportunities where ASM can deliver added value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with customer and product teams to execute penetration and defense strategies, including product demonstrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate internally to plan, collect data, analyze results, and report on customer demos for existing process applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute simple DOE (Design of Experiments) evaluations to characterize process windows for new installations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct experiments and tests, analyze data, and prepare comprehensive reports for internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support tool installation and process qualification activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ph.D. in Chemistry, Materials Science, Physics, Electrical Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What sets you apart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience in semiconductor device fabrication, particularly thin-film deposition processes (ALD, PEALD, Epitaxy, PECVD, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with 3D NAND flash memory processes and integration is a strong advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of semiconductor device physics and electrical characterization techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in statistical analysis tools such as JMP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional verbal and written communication skills, with the ability to convey complex technical concepts clearly and concisely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration skills to work effectively with diverse teams and meet project milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a fab environment, including wearing cleanroom garments and performing standby duties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to support short-term overseas assignments.&lt;/li&gt;
