&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work location &amp;amp; transfer requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For your first 18-24 months, you’ll complete your training at one of our flagship process development hubs in Leuven (Belgium), in or Helsinki (Finland), Upon completion, you will transfer to one of our Key Product Unit (KPU) Process teams for a permanent role in ASM in:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
