&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job&#39;s mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer at ASM, you&#39;ll work at the intersection of advanced software, complex hardware&amp;nbsp;systems, and real-world customer impact. Based in Singapore, you will serve as a technical leader, solving&lt;br&gt;challenging software issues that improve the reliability, safety, and performance of semiconductor&amp;nbsp;manufacturing equipment used by customers around the globe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll lead complex investigations, influence system architecture decisions, and drive long-term&amp;nbsp;software improvements that support next-generation semiconductor manufacturing technology. You will play&lt;br&gt;a key role in advancing ASM&#39;s software engineering capabilities through the responsible adoption of AI enabled development, helping teams accelerate problem resolution, improve software quality, and scale&amp;nbsp;engineering excellence across global product platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be working on&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
