&lt;li&gt;Diagnose and resolve advanced system, hardware, and process issues, including escalations beyond standard support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive root cause and corrective action activities and implement sustainable solutions across tools, customer sites, and product lines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support new product introduction, including early builds, lab validation, and ramp-up to high-volume manufacturing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead or support first-in-fab Alpha and Beta deployments, including installation, start-up, and qualification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate field and customer feedback into improvements in equipment design, performance, and reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive improvements in yield, equipment performance, and uptime in demanding semiconductor manufacturing environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and share best practices, technical documentation, and training materials aligned with global standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with hardware, software, controls, quality, reliability, and process engineering teams across our global organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage directly with customers to understand technical challenges and influence effective solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
