&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Network Engineer is responsible for the design, implementation, operation, and governance of global network infrastructure, connectivity services, and transformation initiatives. This role provides technical leadership across enterprise networking, SD-WAN, network security, cloud connectivity, OT/industrial networking, and managed services supporting manufacturing, R&amp;amp;D, laboratory, and corporate environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The position partners with business stakeholders, site IT teams, cybersecurity teams, vendors, and service providers to deliver secure, reliable, scalable, and cost-effective network solutions with minimal business disruption.&lt;/p&gt;
