&lt;p&gt;Design, implement, and maintain enterprise WAN, LAN, WLAN, internet, cloud connectivity, and secure remote access solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop architecture standards, technical blueprints, deployment frameworks, and operational documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
