&lt;p&gt;Lead regional network modernization projects, including SD-WAN deployments, carrier transitions, technology refreshes, and security enhancements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop migration strategies, implementation plans, testing procedures, rollback plans, and operational handoff documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordinate deployments, dependencies, risks, schedules, and stakeholder communications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliver projects within approved scope, budget, and timelines while minimizing business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
