&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior / Principal Engineer, Global Product Management, Global Spares &amp;amp; Services&lt;/strong&gt; at ASM, you will play a critical role in defining and driving the strategy for our global spares and service offerings across a growing installed base of semiconductor manufacturing equipment. This role combines commercial strategy, product management, technical expertise, and customer engagement to maximize equipment uptime, process performance, customer satisfaction, and recurring revenue growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;A key focus of this role is leveraging deep knowledge of ASM equipment, process applications, maintenance requirements, and installed-base performance to identify opportunities to improve process capability, increase tool availability and productivity, extend part lifetime, and reduce customers&#39; cost of ownership. This includes developing spares, upgrade, refurbishment, and service offerings that enhance equipment performance, process stability, and operational efficiency. This is an opportunity to influence a global business, shape long-term growth strategies, and drive measurable impact for ASM and its customers.&lt;/p&gt;
