&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain kits schedules aligned with preventive maintenance (PM) cycles and service demand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure accurate PM (preventive maintenance) activity reporting and data sharing with internal teams, external vendors, and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Order fulfillment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain accurate Sales Orders and Reports within SAP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-work with planner/ logistic team for kits-level discrepancies between physical and system inventory records.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
