&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Relationship&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively escalate and follow up on customer requests via phone &amp;amp; email to ensure timely resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate a deep understanding of customer requirements and build strong customer relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
