&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;6-10 years customer service within a high-tech environment is required or an equivalent combination of education and experience from which comparable knowledge, skills and ability has been achieved.&lt;/p&gt;
