&lt;p&gt;- Structured and collaborative problem-solving skills leveraging analytics&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Experience in working with SAP and Microsoft Office (Excel, Word, PowerPoint)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Excellent communication skills, including professional English proficiency (written and spoken) to support global collaboration&lt;/p&gt;
