&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job&#39;s mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Specialist I, HVM Project Management at ASM, you will play a critical role in ensuring alignment across demand, supply, inventory, capacity, production, and logistics activities. You will support the execution of integrated planning processes, enabling efficient operations and reliable customer delivery across the end-to-end supply chain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with Supply Chain, Procurement, Manufacturing, Logistics, and Business stakeholders, you will contribute to supply-demand balancing, risk mitigation, and planning excellence while driving operational efficiency and continuous improvement initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be working on&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Execute end-to-end planning activities across assigned product lines or business areas, supporting alignment from supplier readiness to customer delivery&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Coordinate demand, supply, inventory, capacity, production, and logistics plans to ensure operational continuity&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Support the development and execution of integrated planning strategies aligned with business objectives&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Analyze material and capacity constraints and provide recommendations to support prioritization and allocation decisions&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Identify supply chain risks, potential disruptions, and execution gaps while supporting mitigation and recovery actions&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Maintain visibility across the end-to-end supply chain and proactively highlight issues impacting service performance&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Collaborate with Operations, Supply Chain, Procurement, Manufacturing, and Business stakeholders to drive planning alignment&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Support planning governance processes, reporting frameworks, and data accuracy initiatives&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Track and report key performance indicators including service levels, inventory performance, delivery performance, and planning accuracy&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Support New Product Introduction (NPI), lifecycle transitions, and operational readiness planning activities&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Contribute to continuous improvement, standardization, and process optimization initiatives across planning functions&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Assist with planning system enhancements and digital transformation initiatives&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Engineering, Supply Chain Management, Business, Operations Management, or a related discipline&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8–13 years of experience in end-to-end planning, supply chain management, manufacturing operations, production planning, or related functions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of manufacturing processes, production operations, capacity planning, material management, and order fulfillment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Ability to lead cross-functional teams and drive alignment across Engineering, Manufacturing, Supply Chain, Procurement, Quality, Logistics, and Business stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills with the ability to make data-driven decisions&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience using ERP and planning systems such as SAP, MRP, Kinaxis, or equivalent platforms&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Proven experience managing product ramp-up, production readiness, and volume manufacturing programs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced and dynamic environment&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;High level of ownership, accountability, and execution focus&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot; data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Experience identifying and mitigating operational risks, supply constraints, quality issues, and production disruptions &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot; data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Experience managing customer commitments, delivery performance, and revenue-critical projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
