&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What sets you apart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience in the semiconductor, semiconductor equipment, electronics, or high-tech manufacturing industry&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Hands-on experience with integrated planning processes such as&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;IBP, S&amp;amp;OP, or S&amp;amp;OE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience supporting supply disruption management and recovery planning&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Exposure to global supply chain and manufacturing environments&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong process improvement and operational excellence mindset&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience with data analytics, dashboard development, and planning performance reporting&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience participating in planning system implementation, automation, or digital transformation initiatives&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
