&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job&#39;s mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Senior Digital Marketing Specialist with a creative eye and analytical mindset to join our global marketing and communications team. With 5-8 years of professional experience, ideally within a B2B technology environment, this individual is a storyteller who excels at translating complex technological concepts into engaging digital experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whether crafting high-impact content or diving deep into campaign analytics, you will play a critical role in shaping how we connect with our audiences across ASM owned digital and social channels. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the intersection of digital storytelling, platform strategy, and process efficiency. You will provide critical channel insights into what content resonates most, helping to inform and elevate our broader digital strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a global role and requires the ability to collaborate effectively across time zones and cultures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be working on&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NAVER and regional platform strategy and execution &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Channel strategy &amp;amp; ownership: execute the growth strategy for the official corporate NAVER blog, aligning global content pillars and brand standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NAVER SEO&amp;amp; algorithm optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage local Korean agency to drive brand awareness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide support for other Asia local channel management (e.g. WeChat in China) ensuring global messaging is adapted with local nuance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
