&lt;li&gt;Experience: 5-8 years of experience in digital marketing, preferably within the technology industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Korea office, Dongtan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design fluency: Proficiency in Canva, Adobe Creative Suite (Photoshop, Illustrator) or video editing tools will be a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Digital nativity: You understand the “algorithm” and know how to adapt content for various platforms and cultural contexts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical skillset: Experience in Google Analytics, LinkedIn campaign manager is a significant plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven record in executing digital campaigns to drive social media channel growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language: Fluency in English. Proficiency in Chinese or Japanese is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What sets you apart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hybrid creative: Believe that digital marketing is equal parts art and science, balancing the creative with data-driven decision making. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independence: Operate comfortably as a digital expert within a global framework, taking full ownership of projects from concept to execution to performance reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile learner: Keep pace with the rapid evolution of the tech industry and digital marketing landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative mindset: Enjoy partnering with subject matter experts to extract technical insights and translate into compelling digital stories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform expertise: Deep knowledge of NAVER (must) and LinkedIn/ Instagram (plus) with a strong understanding of how to optimize organic reach without reliance of paid amplification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to work at the forefront of the technology sector, bridging the gap between semiconductor innovation and digital engagement. We offer a global and collaborative environment where your digital insights directly influence our global marketing strategy.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make the tech that enables the chips in devices which improve lives around the world. We do this with an eye to the future, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible through cutting-edge innovation, and driving the next wave of technological breakthroughs that shape how we live, work, and connect.&lt;/p&gt;
