&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job&#39;s mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As a Senior Buyer, you will ensure the uninterrupted supply of critical direct materials that enable manufacturing operations to meet customer demand, production goals, and business growth objectives. This role serves as a strategic link between suppliers and internal stakeholders, driving supplier performance, mitigating supply risks, and supporting key initiatives such as new product introductions, manufacturing ramp-ups, and product transfers. Through data-driven decision making, cross-functional collaboration, and continuous improvement, you will help build a resilient, efficient, and scalable supply chain.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be working on&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the purchasing of direct materials to support production requirements, customer demand, and long-term supply continuity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create, issue, confirm, reschedule, and cancel purchase orders while ensuring alignment with business priorities, inventory strategies, and supply commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead supplier performance management activities to ensure material availability, delivery reliability, and achievement of key business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify, assess, and mitigate supply risks through supplier engagement, contingency planning, and cross-functional collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary purchasing lead for product transfers, manufacturing ramp-ups, and new product introduction activities to ensure uninterrupted material supply.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve complex supplier invoice discrepancies, goods receipt issues, and supply-related escalations in partnership with internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze supplier performance metrics and develop corrective action plans to drive continuous improvements in on-time delivery, responsiveness, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead material expediting efforts and coordinate recovery plans with suppliers to address critical shortages and production impacts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, implement, and optimize supply flexibility programs, including safety stock strategies, vendor-managed inventory (VMI), and other inventory optimization initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strategic supplier relationships that support operational excellence, long-term business growth, and risk mitigation objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with planning, sourcing, engineering, manufacturing, quality, and project management teams to resolve complex supply chain challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead supply chain reviews, production meetings, and cross-functional project discussions related to assigned commodities, suppliers, and business initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous improvement initiatives by identifying process gaps, implementing best practices, and enhancing purchasing efficiency and effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and provide guidance to junior purchasing team members while promoting knowledge sharing and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
