&lt;div&gt;Join us to turn emerging technologies into practical solutions that advance manufacturing and operations. As our AIoT and Intelligent Automation Solutions Engineer, you will design and deliver solutions spanning AIoT, edge intelligence, computer vision, intelligent workflow automation, and emerging humanoid-assisted operations. You will bring ideas from concept and pilot through deployment and scale, working across engineering, operations, OT, IT, cybersecurity, and external partners to create solutions that deliver sustainable operational value.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be working on&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
