&lt;li&gt;+10 years in a leader/ people management role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive knowledge and experience with customer satisfaction, service &amp;amp; spares business, and or account management, preferably within the semiconductor industry. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
