&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ph.D&lt;/strong&gt;. in Materials Science, Chemical Engineering, Physics, or related fields;&amp;nbsp;candidates with a &lt;strong&gt;Master’s degree and 6+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of relevant experience are also welcome.&lt;/div&gt;
