&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;Develop, debug, and maintain PLC programs using Siemens, Allen-Bradley, or Beckhoff platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
