&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job&#39;s mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f1iaxwol&quot;&gt;As ASM continues to strengthen its digital, data, and AI capabilities, we are looking for an AI Financial Operations Specialist II to help bring transparency, accountability, and insight to AI investments across the organization.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f1iaxwol&quot;&gt;In this role, you will support the development and execution of ASM’s AI Financial Operations practices, helping stakeholders understand AI consumption, costs, and value realization. By combining financial analysis, cost management, and business insight, you will enable informed decision-making that maximizes the value of AI while promoting responsible and efficient use of resources.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f1iaxwol&quot;&gt;Working within the Value Realization Office and collaborating closely with Finance, Procurement, Data &amp;amp; AI Intelligence, Digital &amp;amp; AI Services, Infrastructure &amp;amp; Cloud, and business stakeholders, you will help establish reporting, forecasting, optimization, and governance practices that connect AI investments to measurable business outcomes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be working on&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support AI Financial Operations practices&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;Support the development and continuous improvement of ASM’s AI Financial Operations processes, standards, and reporting practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;Help maintain visibility into AI-related costs and usage across models, copilots, agents, cloud services, data platforms, licenses, and vendor solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;Contribute to establishing cost attribution and allocation methodologies that improve transparency and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;Support showback and chargeback processes in collaboration with Finance and other stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;Assist in embedding AI cost considerations into business cases, planning cycles, and budgeting activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Analyze AI consumption and cost performance&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;Monitor AI consumption and spending trends across platforms, services, and solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;Analyze usage data and identify key cost drivers, anomalies, optimization opportunities, and potential risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain financial reports, dashboards, and forecasts that provide visibility into AI investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;Support budget tracking, variance analysis, and cost forecasting activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;Partner with technical teams to identify opportunities that improve efficiency and optimize AI-related spending.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;Help develop reusable financial models and benchmarks for common AI solution patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Support value realization and governance&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;Partner with business and transformation stakeholders to establish cost baselines, value assumptions, and success measures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;Track adoption, spending, and realized benefits across AI initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;Prepare data-driven insights and recommendations that support investment and governance discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;Contribute to regular reporting on costs, forecasts, adoption metrics, risks, and optimization opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;Help ensure financial data accuracy and consistency across reporting processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Contribute to vendor and commercial management&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;Support reviews of AI pricing models, licensing structures, and vendor commercial arrangements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;Assist in evaluating the total cost of ownership of AI-enabled solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;Participate in reviews that promote cost-conscious and value-driven decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;Stay informed on emerging AI technologies, pricing trends, and industry best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Finance, Economics, Business, Information Systems, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 3 years of experience in Financial Operations, technology finance, financial planning and analysis, IT financial management, cost management, or a related discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting financial reporting, forecasting, budgeting, or cost-management processes within a global organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of consumption-based technology cost models, including cloud services, software licensing, data platforms, and AI-related services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience performing financial analysis and interpreting complex usage, billing, or cost data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills with a high level of accuracy and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience preparing reports and communicating insights to business and technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to collaborate effectively across Finance, Procurement, Technology, and business teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What sets you apart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting Financial Operations or cloud financial management programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI technologies and their associated cost drivers, including models, agents, cloud infrastructure, and data services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with showback, chargeback, cost allocation, or value realization practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a semiconductor, engineering, or high-tech manufacturing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional certifications related to finance, accounting, financial analysis, cloud financial management, or Financial Operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to improve processes, establish structure, and drive continuous improvement in a changing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
