&lt;li&gt;Collect, analyze,interpret and publish operational data and performance metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare regular reports, dashboards, and KPI scorecards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify trends, risks, and opportunities based on operational performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Coordination&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support operational projects, system implementations, and organizational initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track project milestones, action items, and deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with change management activities and user adoption efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate testing, training, and process documentation for new initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Experience&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2-5 years customer service within a high tech environment is required or an equivalent combination of education and experience from which comparable knowledge, skills and ability has been achieved.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Business Administration, Operations Management, Supply Chain, Engineering, or related field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2-5 years of experience in operations, supply chain, customer service, logistics, or a related business function.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proficiency in Microsoft Excel, Power BI, and Microsoft Office Suite.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience using ERP, CRM, or operational management systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Knowledge of supply chain, inventory management, or customer operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Project management experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
