&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is a transformative moment for the semiconductor industry&amp;nbsp;and every device it powers.&amp;nbsp;As intelligence, efficiency, and materials innovation&amp;nbsp;redefine&amp;nbsp;what is possible, the&amp;nbsp;experiences&amp;nbsp;ASM create matter more than ever.&amp;nbsp;We’re&amp;nbsp;looking for a Global Events Specialist with 4-6&amp;nbsp;years of experience&amp;nbsp;who&amp;nbsp;will play a critical role in bringing ASM’s brand, technology leadership, and corporate narrative to life through&amp;nbsp;global,&amp;nbsp;world-class events.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are&amp;nbsp;looking for&amp;nbsp;a highly organized teammate, passionate about executing events&amp;nbsp;that&amp;nbsp;build&amp;nbsp;meaningful connections with customers,&amp;nbsp;partners, and within our&amp;nbsp;ASM colleagues and&amp;nbsp;community.&amp;nbsp;This person will ensure flawless execution of internal and external events, including conferences,&amp;nbsp;industry shows,&amp;nbsp;public announcements, and employee&amp;nbsp;celebrations.&amp;nbsp;Reporting to the&amp;nbsp;global lead&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;External Communications and Events,&amp;nbsp;you&amp;nbsp;will&amp;nbsp;oversee&amp;nbsp;the execution of ASM’s global event and conference portfolio in partnership with&amp;nbsp;the Marketing&amp;nbsp;and Communications team.&amp;nbsp;This is a visible role that demands comfort working directly with senior leadership and thriving within a truly diverse&amp;nbsp;company. You will work&amp;nbsp;across cultures, time zones, and regions to&amp;nbsp;bring our most impactful events to life&amp;nbsp;worldwide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We’re&amp;nbsp;looking for someone who will&amp;nbsp;deliver&amp;nbsp;flawlessly executed,&amp;nbsp;premium experiences that reflect ASM&#39;s brand. Every event you orchestrate should feel intentional, memorable, and distinctly ASM. If&amp;nbsp;you&#39;re&amp;nbsp;passionate about bringing concepts to life,&amp;nbsp;managing every detail with care and&amp;nbsp;precision,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;continuously raising the bar for attendee experience, we want to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
