&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Specialist II, Service Operations plays a critical role in supporting ASM&#39;s European Service organization through the administration of spare parts, service operations, procurement activities, and office management. This position serves as a key interface between customers, Field Service teams, Service Management, Finance, and suppliers, ensuring efficient execution of service processes, timely customer support, and accurate business administration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will be highly organized, detail-oriented, customer-focused, and capable of managing multiple priorities in a fast-paced, international environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Service Administration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create service quotations for both contract and time-and-material services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and maintain service contracts and service orders within SAP S/4HANA, including equipment assignments and billing plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support service invoicing activities in collaboration with regional customer support teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and report on key service performance indicators, including Field Service inventory management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage service work-in-progress (WIP) and deferred revenue activities in partnership with Finance and Business Control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support monthly forecasting activities with Service and Marketing leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure accurate administration and tracking of service-related transactions and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Procurement &amp;amp; Purchasing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and manage purchase requisitions (PRs) and purchase orders (POs) for internal purchases and service projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Obtain supplier quotations and support procurement activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate order processing and purchasing administration in collaboration with other administrative team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Office &amp;amp; Administrative Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate travel and hotel bookings for employees and visitors, managing relationships and annual agreements with local hotel partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage relationships and annual agreements with local hotel partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle incoming and outgoing mail and courier services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate activities with external vendors and service providers, including ordering and managing office supplies and equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support office health, safety, and workplace standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organize customer and employee events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage day to day fleet operations, vehicle allocation, lease administration, vendor interactions, reporting and issue resolutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
