&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manufacturing Technician II&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Manufacturing Technician II, you&#39;ll thrive in a fast-paced environment, focusing on assembling and testing electro-mechanical modules and systems per manufacturing protocols and quality benchmarks. You&#39;ll utilize test equipment, create build procedures, and provide meticulous support to manufacturing and engineering teams, ensuring precision in every task. This position mandates an on-site presence at our Chandler, Arizona facility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Duties and Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performing pre-assembly functions such as staging, pre-cleaning, and quality inspection of components per established procedures and specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assembling and testing of complex electro-mechanical modules and systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintaining accurate assembly procedures and clear documentation to assure manufacturing is in accordance with internal and external quality systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting stockroom activities to include organizing and documenting activities relating to specific tool staging projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitoring of operating equipment and reporting of substandard conditions to ensure systems are maintained according to standard operating procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Applying lean manufacturing principles to eliminate waste and reduce output variation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compliance with all company policies and procedures will be required to promote a safe and efficient work environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired skill and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read and/or interpret manufacturing prints/blueprints, schematics, and work instructions required to build complex sub-systems and modules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Electro-Mechanical or Mechanical Assembly certification, or other related certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic knowledge of how to use various diagnostic equipment such as multi-meters and other measurement devices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled use of basic hand tools such as wire crimpers, wire strippers, torque wrenches, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Key understanding of mechanics and electronics workings in computer-controlled systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with basic tools, standard concepts, practices, and procedures in an electro-mechanical assembly environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to carry out work assignments with limited guidance beyond the initial objective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to lift and carry up to 50 lbs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This position requires working closely with all team members. A positive attitude and effective interaction with others are essential to success in this role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education and other Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High School Diploma or Associate Degree.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous on-the-job training for semiconductor tool sets, or experience in a manufacturing role combined with the demonstrated ability to perform level I and II tasks per training guidelines preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to maintain regular, punctual attendance consistent with our company policy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
